    "title": "If TDF stopped, switch to ABC+3TC+DTG",
    "message": "Guidelines recommend ABC + 3TC + DTG as the alternative regimen when renal impairment develops due to TDF. The clinician is considering stopping TDF permanently. If the creatinine does not recover after rehydration and TDF toxicity or TDF-related renal impairment is confirmed, the guideline-directed replacement regimen is ABC + 3TC + DTG. The plan should specify the switch regimen rather than leaving the replacement undefined.",
